---
title: "About — Oghenemaro Okolosio"
description: "Experience, consulting work and skills of Oghenemaro Okolosio: lead engineer at Union Bank of Nigeria, formerly five years at Stanbic IBTC Bank."
layout: layouts/main.njk
---

<section class="section intro">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="role">{{ cv.role }} · {{ cv.location }}</p>

  <p>
    The thing nobody tells you about software is how much of it is about
    waiting. The page that takes ten seconds. The job with no progress bar. The
    status that changed on the server but not on the screen. Most of my work
    has been closing those gaps — in payments, lending, onboarding and
    reporting systems that real customers depend on.
  </p>
  <p>
    I own features end to end: shaping requirements with product, designing
    the system, writing it, testing it, shipping it and watching it in
    production. I like small teams where engineers review each other's code,
    mentor, and shape the architecture rather than wait for it.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Experience</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for job in cv.experience %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">{{ job.period }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="title">
            {{ job.role }},
            <a href="{{ job.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ job.company }}</a>
          </p>
          <p class="desc">{{ job.summary }}</p>
          <ul>
            {% for point in job.points %}<li>{{ point }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <p class="stack">{{ job.stack }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Consulting</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for job in cv.consulting %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">{{ job.period }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="title">
            {{ job.role }},
            {% if job.url %}
              <a href="{{ job.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ job.company }}</a>
            {% else %}
              {{ job.company }}
            {% endif %}
          </p>
          <p class="desc">{{ job.summary }}</p>
          <ul>
            {% for point in job.points %}<li>{{ point }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <p class="stack">{{ job.stack }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Skills</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for group in cv.skills %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">{{ group.label }}</span>
        <p>{{ group.items }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Education</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    <li class="row">
      <span class="aside">{{ cv.education.year }}</span>
      <div>
        <p class="title">{{ cv.education.degree }}</p>
        <p class="desc">
          <a href="{{ cv.education.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ cv.education.school }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
